[31m-[m
[31m-## 3. Test SMTP[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```powershell[m
[31m-node scripts/testEmail.js[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-[m
[31m-The test sends a message to `SMTP_TEST_TO` if configured; otherwise it sends to `FOODE_EMAIL` (or legacy `SMTP_USER`). A successful test confirms SMTP authentication and one test send only.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-## 4. Auth routes[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- `POST /api/auth/send-email-otp` — send registration OTP to `@srmap.edu.in`.[m
[31m-- `POST /api/auth/resend-email-otp` — resend registration OTP with a cooldown.[m
[31m-- `POST /api/auth/verify-email` — verify registration OTP.[m
[31m-- `POST /api/auth/register` — create a customer only if email verification is valid; fields: `name`, `email`, `phone`, `password`.[m
[31m-- `POST /api/auth/login` — mobile number + password.[m
[31m-- `POST /api/auth/forgot-password` — send reset OTP to a registered, verified SRM AP email.[m
[31m-- `POST /api/auth/verify-reset-otp` — verify reset OTP.[m
[31m-- `POST /api/auth/reset-password` — body: `email`, `otp`, `newPassword`.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-OTPs are hashed in MongoDB, expire after five minutes, and have a five-attempt limit. Passwords are bcrypt-hashed. Public registration always assigns the `user` role.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-## 5. Important launch notes[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- Email delivery depends on valid SMTP credentials and the provider's quota. Gmail SMTP does not guarantee 1,000 messages per day or 1,000 simultaneous deliveries. Confirm provider limits before public launch.[m
[31m-- The frontend should call `/send-email-otp`, then `/verify-email`, then `/register` using the same verified email.[m
[31m-- Forgot-password UI should collect the registered `@srmap.edu.in` email, OTP, and new password.[m
[31m-- Test against a development database before production.[m
[31m-- The `.env` file and `node_modules` are intentionally not included in this ZIP.[m
